Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,In World War Two,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.41,0:00:03.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,one of Poland's soldiers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.03,0:00:04.31,Cap,,0,0,0,,was a bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.31,0:00:05.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,An actual bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:07.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Iran,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,nineteen forty-two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:10.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Polish soldiers met a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:12.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,boy carrying a tiny
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:12.95,Cap,,0,0,0,,bear cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.95,0:00:13.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,They traded for it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.91,0:00:15.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,and named him Wojtek.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,They raised him like
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:17.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,a little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.78,0:00:18.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,He drank milk from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.81,0:00:19.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,a vodka bottle,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.85,0:00:21.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,wrestled the troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.14,0:00:21.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,and slept curled
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:22.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,up next to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.51,0:00:23.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,them at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:24.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,There was just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:25.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:26.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,The army didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:27.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,allow pets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:28.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,So they made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,him a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:31.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,Private Wojtek got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.51,0:00:32.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,his own rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.26,0:00:33.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,his own rations and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:35.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,his own serial number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.69,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then came Monte Cassino.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.69,0:00:38.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,The soldiers swore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.68,0:00:39.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,he copied them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.91,0:00:41.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,carrying heavy crates of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:42.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,artillery shells up to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.52,0:00:43.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:44.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,They were so proud,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.22,0:00:45.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,they promoted him to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:46.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,corporal and put him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:47.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,on their badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.78,0:00:48.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,A bear holding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.91,0:00:49.99,Cap,,0,0,0,,a shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.99,0:00:50.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,After the war,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.85,0:00:52.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,Wojtek retired to a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.35,0:00:53.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,zoo in Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:54.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,And when his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.09,0:00:55.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,old comrades visited,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:56.45,Cap,,0,0,0,,they climbed right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:57.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,into his enclosure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.72,0:00:58.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,to wrestle him.
